


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

LOG FILE FOR HEADER SYNC RUNS;

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------



-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Initial Creation Note : (METADATA)
-
- On 03-11-2025  finally the long term dream of automating hadersync was created.
- With growing number of functions and repos it was getting extremly difficult to keep changes in 
- each of these repos under manual track. Hence there was a long term plan to have create a single
- .header repo that contains all the header files and have these refletcted on 
- all other repos as needed.
- 
-
- That master .header repo is now available at : https://github.com/sagnikrg/.header
-
- While modifying the old headersync.bat script to make it as automated as possible, we switched to using robocopy instead of xcopy.
- to mirror directories and delete files that are not present in source. It also samples the repo names directly now, so that this script
- can be made part of .template and be used exactly as intended without any manual modifications.
-
-
- While working on this I also realised it can also be used to automatically print logs in journal style, saving us from the trouble of manually udating wiki!
-
-
- This file is the result of that effort and henceforth will contain all the logs of
- ALL updates in the https://github.com/sagnikrg/.header repo! :D
-
-
-
-
-
- PS: This new script will also be modded soon to create the new bibsync.bat to sync the splitted .bib files from notes/tex/.src/.bib
- to completely automate the two most time consuming redundant tasks.
-
-
- You are Welcome ! :D  
-
- Sagnik (sagnikrg)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------









